<title>SWITZERLAND: RESEARCH ALERT-CSFB reiterates Ascom buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-CSFB reiterates Ascom buy.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>CSFB reaffirmed its buy recommendation for shares of Swiss telecommunications group Ascom Holding and raised its 12-month price target to 2,600 Swiss francs. Shares were trading today at 2,020.</p>
<p>&quot;At the current price level (of 1,980) the market is not even paying its adjusted equity capital,&quot; analyst Felix Stadelmann wrote in a research note, giving these estimates:</p>
<p>		Net profit (mln Sfr)   EPS (Sfr)    P/E (x)</p>
<p> 1997	 79.0			 175.5	   11.3</p>
<p> 1998	105.3			 233.9	    8.5</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
